      "lastModifiedUtc": "2025-10-13T11:30:13.0153121Z",
      "query": "SigninLogs\r\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)   // adjust as needed\r\n| where ResultType == 0           // Successful authentication\r\n| where ConditionalAccessStatus == \"failure\"\r\n| mv-expand ConditionalAccessPolicies\r\n| project TimeGenerated,\r\n          UserPrincipalName,\r\n          AppDisplayName,\r\n          IPAddress,\r\n          Location,\r\n          ConditionalAccessPolicy = tostring(ConditionalAccessPolicies.policyName),\r\n          PolicyResult = tostring(ConditionalAccessPolicies.result),\r\n          ResultDescription",
